# ee/ ships in the image since the ee->futureagi code move (TH-7256): the
# license (EE_LICENSE_KEY), not code stripping, gates paid features now.
# The cloud-private delta is a separate repo (future-agi/ee) checked out at
# ee/cloud/, so that one rule covers everything it owns. It is gitignored
# (absent in CI checkouts) but present on dev machines — exclude it so local
# builds match what CI and a fresh clone produce. The CE base image must not
# carry cloud code; Dockerfile.ee in the private repo overlays it.
ee/cloud/
ee.local-leftover/

# Test suites and test-only files (21.7 MB of tests + 2.4 MB .test_durations
# in the v1.41 image). CI runs pytest from a checkout, never inside this image,
# and no runtime module imports a `*.tests` package. Deliberately NOT
# `test_*.py`: runtime modules use that name (simulate/models/test_execution.py,
# ai_tools/tools/evaluations/test_eval_template.py, ee/voice/tasks/test_monitor.py).
**/tests/
**/conftest.py
.test_durations
.test_quarantine.json
requirements-test.txt
mypy-baseline.txt
pytest.ini
dockerfile.base
Dockerfile.oss
.secrets.baseline
.pre-commit-config.yaml
.flake8

